{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33171","headline":"锄草怨 · 司马扎","name":"锄草怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种田望雨多，雨多长蓬蒿。\n亦念官赋急，宁知荷锄劳。\n亭午霁日明，邻翁醉陶陶。\n乡吏不到门，禾黍苗自高。\n独有辛苦者，屡爲州县徭。\n罢锄田又废，恋乡不忍逃。\n出门吏相促，邻家满仓谷。\n邻翁不可告，尽日向田哭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}